'''Reminder:''' Game Updates are now accompanied by a 30-minute downtime period to ensure we can take an up-to-date backup. Game Worlds will be offline at '''11:30 GMT''' and should be back online at '''12:00 GMT'''.

Next week's game update is the final update of the year and will be taking place on Tuesday, 12th December. As it stands, Leagues will remain as it is over the Christmas period after next week's update unless there are major bugs or issues that need addressing. Please continue to report your bugs and issues via the in-game Bug Report feature.

We’ve been busy making important QoL changes to Leagues IV: Trailblazer Reloaded. Check the changelog for a breakdown of all this week’s updates!

Plus: get ready for the 2023 Christmas Event, coming next week!

==Changelog - December 6th==
{{Collapsed section|18|CLICK HERE TO SHOW}}

'''Leagues IV Changes'''

* Added a toggle to the Guardian Horn which automatically summons the Guardian during combat.
* Region-specific Combat Achievements will now be auto-completed.
* Using Globetrotter's last destination will now correctly account for Dragonstone jewellery teleports, so it can be used in up to level 30 Wilderness.
* Reduced the maximum amount of Soul Wars Points players can use at one time to 1,000 to prevent glitches caused by players receiving too much XP at once.
* Players who reach the point threshold for Combat Achievement tiers will now correctly unlock that tier, instead of needing at least one point over the threshold.
* The non-Leagues Vengeance spell now uses the original sound instead of the Trailblazer version. You can pick your favourite by right-clicking the spell if you've unlocked the Leagues Vengeance.
* Equipping any combination of Gold/Normal Prospector outfit parts now correctly completes the ’Equip a Full Prospector Outfit’ task.
* Tumeken's Shadow now benefits from the attack speed increase from Superior Sorcerer in Soul Wars.
* Fixed an issue where the Guardian was not stunning the Abyssal Sire correctly.
* Corrected the ‘Create 100 Divine Super Potions’ task to ‘Create 50 Divine Super Combat Potions’.
* The Leagues IV emote will now correctly show if the player has the full set of Leagues IV Relic Hunter on their League Outfit Stand.
* Fixed an issue where the ‘Equip Every Draconic Shield’ task could not be completed.
* Having a Clue Nest, Geode or Bottle in your Bank will now allow you to pick up a Clue Scroll.
* The ‘Complete all Muspah Combat Achievements’ task will now be checked off when the requirements are met.
* Fixed an issue where Zimberfizz would try to escape the Soul Wars tutorial. Not today, pal!
* Removed the Kourend task ‘Equip a Full Angler’s Outfit’ as there is a global task with the same requirements.
* Nex will now count towards the 100/250/500 God Wars Dungeon KC tasks.
* The PoH Leagues Trophy Room Scroll now correctly states the player's rank from previous Leagues.
* Hit splats on the Guardian and Thralls will now no longer show incorrect max hits.
* Fixed clipping issues that occurred when performing the new Alchemy animations while wearing items in both hands.
* Using Purge as one of three different Prayer drain methods will now count towards completing the ‘Versatile Drainer’ Combat Achievement.
* Updated the Leagues Firsts board.
* Added a warning if your Guardian has the rare outfit when you reroll.

'''Other Changes'''

* Removed level up messages for the Ruinous Powers.
* Party balloons in Clan Halls should no longer drop inside the walls.
* The Pursuer will no longer attack players when they are on a different level to it.
* Players should no longer get stuck when generating new floors of the Sepulchre.

'''PvP Rota'''

World 569 (AUS) for Bounty Hunter has been <u>'''activated'''</u> with this rota.

The PvP rota has moved to '''Period B''':

